WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.837
-The President openly celebrated
violence against a reporter

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:07.707
as Saudi Arabia lied about
the death of a journalist.

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:10.209
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:15.081
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:17.449
Tonight, President Trump
traveled to Texas

00:00:17.449 --> 00:00:20.653
to campaign for his former
nemesis, Senator Ted Cruz.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.889
Trump, of course,
famously called him Lying Ted

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:26.226
during the 2016 campaign,
but on his way to Texas,

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:28.828
he was asked by reporters
if he still felt that way,

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:30.897
and he gave Cruz a new nickname.

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:33.433
-Is he no longer Lying Ted?

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:35.234
-To me,
he's not Lying Ted anymore.

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:36.769
-What is he now?
-He's Beautiful Ted.

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:40.440
-No. No, you can call Ted Cruz
a lot of things,

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.875
but "beautiful"
is not one of them.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.108
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.108 --> 00:00:46.012
Ted Cruz once took a picture
with a butter cow,

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:48.047
and the only thing
that looked like it was melting

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.482
was Ted Cruz.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:51.284
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:53.186
Trump is pulling out
all the stops for the midterms

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:55.321
to try to avoid
the impending blue wave,

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:58.057
and the reason these midterms
feel so tense is that right now,

00:00:58.057 --> 00:01:00.960
millions of Americans feel
their democracy isn't working.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.296
Republicans are illegally
purging voters

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:04.930
and gerrymandering districts.

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:06.799
Four Justices
on the Supreme Court

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:08.934
have now been appointed
by two presidents

00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:10.669
who lost the popular vote.

00:01:10.669 --> 00:01:13.940
And the most recent nominee was
confirmed by a Senate majority

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:16.042
that actually represents
fewer Americans

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:17.643
than in the Senate minority.

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:19.245
What we now have
is a system that does

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:21.014
the opposite
of what the people want.

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:23.182
It's like if Lays
let everybody vote

00:01:23.182 --> 00:01:25.952
on a new potato-chip flavor,
and a month later,

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:28.788
they announced that the winner
was fried liver and cilantro.

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:30.323
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:31.757
You'd be like,
"I think something

00:01:31.757 --> 00:01:33.426
might be wrong
with the voting system."

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:34.494
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:36.496
People are angry
that a minority faction

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:38.964
is ruling the country and
ignoring what most people want,

00:01:38.964 --> 00:01:41.000
and they've expressed that anger
in various ways,

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.035
like confronting politicians
in public

00:01:43.035 --> 00:01:45.004
or protesting in the Capitol.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.839
And Republicans
have responded to that fury

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:49.875
by calling their own
constituents paid protestors

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:52.879
and claiming the left
is practicing mob violence.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:56.916
-When you have nothing to run on
over the last two years,

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:59.385
then you turn to something
that is popular

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:02.555
among the liberal mob
on the left, right? Violence.

00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:07.026
-We will not be bullied by
the screams of paid protesters

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:09.028
and name-calling by the mob.

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:11.597
-The far left mob
is not letting up.

00:02:11.597 --> 00:02:15.735
-You don't hand matches
to an arsonist.

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:20.239
And you don't give power
to an angry, left-wing mob,

00:02:20.239 --> 00:02:21.807
and that's what they've become.

00:02:21.807 --> 00:02:24.177
The choice
could not be more clear.

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:27.479
Democrats produce mobs.

00:02:27.479 --> 00:02:30.450
Republicans produce jobs.

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:35.922
-First of all, when Trump finds
a rhyme like "mobs" and "jobs,"

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:37.823
that's his Gettysburg Address.

00:02:37.823 --> 00:02:39.759
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:45.131
'Cause that's really...

00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:49.401
And you know he was up all night
trying to crack that one.

00:02:49.401 --> 00:02:52.939
"Democrats produce mobs.

00:02:52.939 --> 00:02:56.642
Republicans
produce fob-- fobs?

00:02:56.642 --> 00:02:59.512
Bobs, knobs --
Oh! Oh! Jobs!"

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:03.916
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:03:03.916 --> 00:03:09.722
Second, you're accusing
Democrats of acting like a mob?

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:13.193
Because I can only remember
one mob in recent history,

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:15.561
and I'm positive
they weren't Democrats.

00:03:15.561 --> 00:03:18.898
Democrats only use tiki torches
to keep mosquitos away

00:03:18.898 --> 00:03:20.333
from their vegan barbecues.

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:21.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:23.569
You guys are the ones
who run the government

00:03:23.569 --> 00:03:24.938
like a protection racket.

00:03:24.938 --> 00:03:26.372
Republicans all look like
they should be

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:28.073
cracking their knuckles
in a butcher shop,

00:03:28.073 --> 00:03:30.143
telling the owner,
"Nice place you got here.

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:31.811
Would be a shame
if something happened to it."

00:03:31.811 --> 00:03:32.845
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:34.880
If you took any photo
of Trump's aides

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:38.017
and added Clemenza
from "The Godfather,"

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:39.685
no one would notice.

00:03:39.685 --> 00:03:41.153
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:41.153 --> 00:03:43.522
They'd notice the hat.

00:03:43.522 --> 00:03:45.591
And then, on Friday,
Trump posted yet another

00:03:45.591 --> 00:03:47.793
one of his weird
Rose Garden Twitter videos

00:03:47.793 --> 00:03:50.963
where he again claimed Democrats
were an angry mob.

00:03:50.963 --> 00:03:54.166
-The Democrats don't like
being called an angry mob,

00:03:54.166 --> 00:03:56.735
but, really,
that's what they've become.

00:03:56.735 --> 00:03:58.637
They've gone so far left,

00:03:58.637 --> 00:04:01.107
they can't even believe
that they're over there.

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:02.608
They don't know that's going on.

00:04:02.608 --> 00:04:05.377
They're losing it,
and they shouldn't be.

00:04:05.377 --> 00:04:06.913
-They're losing it?

00:04:06.913 --> 00:04:08.680
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:14.020
You look like you just wandered
out of those bushes

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.488
and made a stranger
point a camera at you.

00:04:16.488 --> 00:04:20.560
It looks like a Bigfoot video
where Bigfoot decided

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.327
to try his hand
at public speaking.

00:04:22.327 --> 00:04:23.529
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:23.529 --> 00:04:27.433
"Me Bigfoot.
Bigfoot friend.

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:31.303
Bigfoot...friend.

00:04:31.303 --> 00:04:33.406
Don't chase Bigfoot."

00:04:33.406 --> 00:04:34.707
So, Republicans
are accusing the left

00:04:34.707 --> 00:04:36.075
of acting like a violent mob.

00:04:36.075 --> 00:04:38.544
Meanwhile, there are Republicans
who are literally violent,

00:04:38.544 --> 00:04:40.679
like Montana Congressman
Greg Gianforte,

00:04:40.679 --> 00:04:43.782
who pled guilty to physically
assaulting a reporter last year

00:04:43.782 --> 00:04:45.818
when that reporter
tried to ask Gianforte

00:04:45.818 --> 00:04:47.286
a question about healthcare.

00:04:47.286 --> 00:04:50.089
And in case you forgot what that
sounded like, here's the audio.

00:04:50.089 --> 00:04:52.291
-You've been waiting to make
your decision about healthcare

00:04:52.291 --> 00:04:54.560
until you saw the bill,
and it just came out.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.762
-We'll talk to you
about that later.

00:04:55.762 --> 00:04:57.530
-Yeah, but there's
not gonna be time.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:00.098
-Okay.
Speak with Shane, please.

00:05:00.098 --> 00:05:02.334
[ Rustling, crashing ]

00:05:02.334 --> 00:05:03.969
I'm sick and tired of you guys!

00:05:03.969 --> 00:05:06.204
The last guy that came in here,
you did the same thing!

00:05:06.204 --> 00:05:07.706
Get the hell out of here!

00:05:07.706 --> 00:05:10.843
-Man, it is amazing how often
Republicans get caught

00:05:10.843 --> 00:05:12.712
doing [bleep] things on tape.

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:15.214
I mean, a Congressman was taped
body-slamming a reporter.

00:05:15.214 --> 00:05:18.117
Trump was taped discussing
a payment to cover up an affair.

00:05:18.117 --> 00:05:19.418
And Steven Miller was taped

00:05:19.418 --> 00:05:21.654
eating his lunch
in the White House basement.

00:05:21.654 --> 00:05:23.422
-Okay, Steven,
time for your feeding.

00:05:23.422 --> 00:05:26.992
-[ Shrieking ]

00:05:26.992 --> 00:05:28.294
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:28.294 --> 00:05:31.464
-So, last week Trump,
the law-and-order president,

00:05:31.464 --> 00:05:34.867
went to Montana to campaign for
violent criminal Greg Gianforte,

00:05:34.867 --> 00:05:37.002
and he made it clear
that he is totally against

00:05:37.002 --> 00:05:39.171
