00:05:39.171 --> 00:05:40.806
unless it's
a sick wrestling move,

00:05:40.806 --> 00:05:42.274
in which case,
he thinks it's awesome.

00:05:42.274 --> 00:05:43.342
-Greg is smart.

00:05:43.342 --> 00:05:45.912
And by the way,
never wrestle him.

00:05:45.912 --> 00:05:47.146
You understand that?
Never.

00:05:47.146 --> 00:05:49.281
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:49.281 --> 00:05:52.551
Any guy that can do a body slam,
he's my kind of --

00:05:52.551 --> 00:05:57.056
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:57.056 --> 00:05:58.991
He's my guy.

00:05:58.991 --> 00:06:01.427
-So Trump says a congressman
who body-slammed a reporter

00:06:01.427 --> 00:06:02.761
is his kind of guy.

00:06:02.761 --> 00:06:05.231
And let's not forget,
Trump also told his supporters

00:06:05.231 --> 00:06:06.999
to knock the crap
out of protesters

00:06:06.999 --> 00:06:09.134
and promised to pay
their legal fees if they did.

00:06:09.134 --> 00:06:11.437
He's an actual crime boss.

00:06:11.437 --> 00:06:12.705
I mean, look at him.

00:06:12.705 --> 00:06:14.573
He sweats like
he's being dangled

00:06:14.573 --> 00:06:16.742
off the side of a roof
by Batman.

00:06:16.742 --> 00:06:21.247
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:06:21.247 --> 00:06:24.884
Trump is the classic
fake tough guy from Queens.

00:06:24.884 --> 00:06:27.620
If he weren't president, he'd be
the guy sitting on a park bench

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.922
in Flushing Meadows, saying,
"Who you looking at?"

00:06:29.922 --> 00:06:31.256
to the squirrels.

00:06:31.256 --> 00:06:33.426
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:33.426 --> 00:06:36.128
But Trump's praise for Gianforte
is especially gross

00:06:36.128 --> 00:06:38.197
after the murder
of "Washington Post" columnist

00:06:38.197 --> 00:06:40.099
and U.S. resident
Jamal Khashoggi,

00:06:40.099 --> 00:06:42.668
who disappeared after walking
into the Saudi consulate

00:06:42.668 --> 00:06:44.103
in Istanbul three weeks ago.

00:06:44.103 --> 00:06:46.072
And yet, on Friday,
after a series of lies

00:06:46.072 --> 00:06:48.173
and a sham investigation,
the Saudis released

00:06:48.173 --> 00:06:51.210
a truly absurd account
of Khashoggi's death.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:53.045
-Saudi Arabia
now publicly confirming

00:06:53.045 --> 00:06:54.346
that the Saudi journalist

00:06:54.346 --> 00:06:56.549
and "Washington Post"
contributor Jamal Khashoggi

00:06:56.549 --> 00:06:58.684
is dead
in the middle of the night.

00:06:58.684 --> 00:07:00.453
Announced by officials
in Riyadh,

00:07:00.453 --> 00:07:03.156
said he died as a result
of a physical altercation

00:07:03.156 --> 00:07:05.224
inside the Saudi consulate.

00:07:05.224 --> 00:07:07.559
-State prosecutors
say the Saudi writer,

00:07:07.559 --> 00:07:10.228
last seen walking into the
consulate to get papers

00:07:10.228 --> 00:07:11.997
for his upcoming wedding,

00:07:11.997 --> 00:07:15.467
got into a fistfight
inside that led to his death.

00:07:15.467 --> 00:07:16.536
-That's insane.

00:07:16.536 --> 00:07:18.236
They're claiming
he got into a fistfight

00:07:18.236 --> 00:07:20.373
while he was trying to get
paperwork for his wedding.

00:07:20.373 --> 00:07:23.508
The only time anyone has gotten
into a fistfight over a wedding

00:07:23.508 --> 00:07:25.978
is on MTV's "True Life"
I'm Getting Married."

00:07:25.978 --> 00:07:28.481
-Do you have any [bleep] clue
who you're talking to right now?

00:07:28.481 --> 00:07:30.450
Besides the fact
that it's my [bleep] wedding,

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:32.251
I'll [bleep]
cut you the [bleep] up!

00:07:32.251 --> 00:07:35.521
I will gut you like the [bleep]
piece of [bleep] that you are!

00:07:35.521 --> 00:07:36.922
Do you understand?!

00:07:36.922 --> 00:07:40.092
Don't you [bleep] dare
come up to me like that

00:07:40.092 --> 00:07:41.360
on my [bleep] wedding!

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:44.029
'Cause I'll hunt you down
like [bleep] cattle,

00:07:44.029 --> 00:07:45.464
and I'll gut you!

00:07:45.464 --> 00:07:47.399
[ Laughter, audience "Oohs" ]

00:07:47.399 --> 00:07:49.634
-Our show will never
be as good as that show.

00:07:49.634 --> 00:07:52.872
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:52.872 --> 00:07:57.777
I mean, I'd love to see him
renting that tuxedo.

00:07:57.777 --> 00:08:00.413
"I need a lot of room in my arms
for angry walking!"

00:08:00.413 --> 00:08:05.217
[ Laughter ]

00:08:05.217 --> 00:08:07.853
There's so many reasons
not to believe this obvious lie.

00:08:07.853 --> 00:08:10.756
Multiple suspects have direct
links to the Crown Prince.

00:08:10.756 --> 00:08:14.093
Even Republicans in Congress,
who are fierce allies of Trump,

00:08:14.093 --> 00:08:15.928
have called
this explanation absurd.

00:08:15.928 --> 00:08:19.097
No one, and I mean no one,
is dumb enough to believe

00:08:19.097 --> 00:08:20.699
the Saudi explanation.

00:08:20.699 --> 00:08:24.169
-U.S. President Trump says he
believes the Saudi explanation,

00:08:24.169 --> 00:08:27.139
calling it "a good first step."

00:08:27.139 --> 00:08:29.809
-That's right. Trump said the
Saudi explanation was credible.

00:08:29.809 --> 00:08:31.476
Now, because he won't
release his tax returns,

00:08:31.476 --> 00:08:32.811
we don't know exactly what

00:08:32.811 --> 00:08:35.080
Trump's personal financial ties
are to Saudi Arabia.

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:36.281
Last week, Trump tweeted,

00:08:36.281 --> 00:08:38.451
"I have no financial interest
in Saudi Arabia."

00:08:38.451 --> 00:08:40.385
So you can believe Trump
when he says

00:08:40.385 --> 00:08:42.187
he has no financial interest
in Saudi Arabia,

00:08:42.187 --> 00:08:44.289
or you could take it
from this guy.

00:08:44.289 --> 00:08:46.592
-I love the Saudis.
Many are in this building.

00:08:46.592 --> 00:08:49.428
Saudi Arabia, and I get along
great with all of them.

00:08:49.428 --> 00:08:50.630
They buy apartments from me.

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.497
They spend $40 million,
$50 million.

00:08:52.497 --> 00:08:54.933
Am I supposed to dislike them?
I like them very much.

00:08:54.933 --> 00:08:57.035
-"They give me money,
so I like them,"

00:08:57.035 --> 00:08:59.505
is the literal definition
of a bribe.

00:08:59.505 --> 00:09:00.939
[ Laughter ]

00:09:00.939 --> 00:09:03.109
Trump can be
so disorienting sometimes

00:09:03.109 --> 00:09:06.378
because he just spells out in
plain language why he's corrupt.

00:09:06.378 --> 00:09:09.014
He's like a guy who robbed
a bank, telling the cops,

00:09:09.014 --> 00:09:11.517
"I pointed a gun at the teller,
so he gave me the cash.

00:09:11.517 --> 00:09:13.585
What am I supposed to do?
Not take it?"

00:09:13.585 --> 00:09:17.089
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:17.089 --> 00:09:22.295
So while pundits and Republicans
whine about civility,

00:09:22.295 --> 00:09:24.664
the president was celebrating
violence against a reporter

00:09:24.664 --> 00:09:25.931
and standing by the Saudis.

00:09:25.931 --> 00:09:27.065
It's a protection racket.

00:09:27.065 --> 00:09:28.967
If you pay them off,
they'll protect you.

00:09:28.967 --> 00:09:30.803
There's even a word for that.
It's called...

00:09:30.803 --> 00:09:31.937
-The mob.

00:09:31.937 --> 00:09:33.205
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

00:09:33.205 --> 00:09:37.043
[ Cheers and applause ]

